  "dialog.about.description": "A desktop browser bookmark manager designed to bring order to your collection of saved websites. The program supports importing standard export files in Netscape HTML format from Chrome, Firefox, Edge, Opera, and other browsers. It operates independently, requiring no link to a specific user profile or installed browser. The manager allows you to perform basic operations on bookmarks and folders-such as creating, moving, renaming, and deleting items-to establish a clear and organized storage structure.",
  "dialog.about.features_title": "Features",
  "dialog.about.features": [
    "Basic operations with bookmarks and folders (groups): create, move, rename, edit, and delete;",
    "One-click search for and removal of duplicates based on URL or title, with the option to move duplicates to a separate folder;",
    "Merging multiple export files into a single collection, with automatic consolidation of folders sharing the same name;",
    "Quick search by title and URL within the current scope, allowing navigation between folders without re-typing;",
    "Link availability checks with status detection: online, offline, or redirect;",
    "Cutting and pasting folders across hierarchy levels;",
    "Automatic grouping of bookmarks by domain;",
    "Bulk ungrouping of specific or all groups and deletion of empty folders."
  ],
